Modifications by Towhid Molla:
  - Persist the work countdown as an absolute wall-clock deadline, so the
    timer survives `omarchy restart shell` and a shell crash instead of
    restarting the 20-minute interval.
  - Derive the displayed countdown from the clock rather than decrementing
    it per tick, which also removes drift.
  - Re-ID the plugin from `usutani.eye-care` to `towhid.eye-care`.
  - README updates.

